The Vulkan half of 0088: the used float constants are copied to the constant buffer in runs of consecutive
registers instead of 16 bytes at a time. 0088's vertex buffer residency half has no counterpart since
0171 removed that cache.

diff --git a/src/graphics/vulkan/command_processor.cpp b/src/graphics/vulkan/command_processor.cpp
